<title>USA: Cephalon says Myotrophin hearing set May 8.</title>
<headline>Cephalon says Myotrophin hearing set May 8.</headline>
<dateline>WEST CHESTER, Pa. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cephalon Inc said Monday that the the U.S. Food and Drug Administration has scheduled for May 8 an advisory panel hearing on its application to sell Myotrophin in injectible form in the U.S.</p>
<p>Cephalon and its partner, Chiron Corp, filed the application on the drug on February 11.</p>
<p>The drug is intended for the treatment of amyotrophic lateral sclerosis.</p>
</text>
